            "review_title": "Review at Star Sky Lounge",
            "review_text": "Dec\nVietnam73 contributions\n0\nReally excellent bar with wonderful views\nApr 2019\nGreat 'secret gem' place ...\n\nDon't know about the music that is mentioned - fortunately, there was no loud bands and music on the occasions we were there, just good bg music.\n\nwe enjoyed the wonderful night view from the small tables on the balcony and some great cocktails (and red wine), and i think we had some plates of tapas or similar.\n\ngreat place, but not obvious how to get to (easy after you find it)\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 6, 2020",
